abstract: >-
  Code and filename lists for auditing the iHarmony4 image-harmonization benchmark at the
  real-image construction unit, plus CPU-runnable checks for composite-locality (footprint)
  and for a bounded exterior-input to interior-output sensitivity certificate. The associated
  manuscript is included as paper.pdf in this repository.
